From 2b6d8e4f0a1c3b5d7e9f10293847566554433221 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: panvk-kbase-android worker <panvk-worker@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:10:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH panvk-g610 009] panvk/android: select the ANB fallback layout
 at run time

With csf-v11 004/005/007 a recompiled game (io.github.nfsmwrecomp on a
vivo V2231) imports its window buffers and renders (dumpsys gfxinfo:
538 frames), and csf-v11 008 removed the per-frame
QueueSignalReleaseImageANDROID failure, but the display stays black.
The buffers are 1280x732 at stride 1280 (3747840 = 1280*732*4), so the
size fits both LINEAR and Mali 16x16 U-interleaved: without the gralloc
mapper the modifier cannot be read, and the linear guess may be wrong for
gralloc window buffers.

The fallback now declares DRM_FORMAT_MOD_ARM_16X16_BLOCK_U_INTERLEAVED
when PANVK_ANB_LAYOUT=u-tiled ("tiled" also accepted) or when
/data/local/tmp/panvk_anb_utiled exists, which allows a root shell to
A/B the layout of a stock app without touching its environment.  Linear
stays the default and the log names the choice:

  anb_layout fallback LINEAR|U-TILED fmt=1 stride=1280 ...

Tested GPU: none yet (Mali-G610 MC4 report only)
Validation test: a Vulkan game on Mali-G610 shows frames with one of the
 two layouts

--- a/src/vulkan/runtime/vk_android.c
+++ b/src/vulkan/runtime/vk_android.c
@@ -355,16 +355,27 @@ vk_android_get_anb_layout(
       if (native_buffer->handle && native_buffer->handle->numFds >= 1 &&
           native_buffer->stride > 0 && bpp > 0 &&
           vk_format_get_blockheight(pCreateInfo->format) == 1) {
+         /* Window buffers are not always linear, and without the mapper the
+          * modifier is unknowable: PANVK_ANB_LAYOUT=u-tiled selects Mali
+          * 16x16 U-interleaved instead of LINEAR.
+          */
+         const char *layout = getenv("PANVK_ANB_LAYOUT");
+         const bool tiled = (layout && (!strcmp(layout, "u-tiled") ||
+                                        !strcmp(layout, "tiled"))) ||
+                            access("/data/local/tmp/panvk_anb_utiled", F_OK) == 0;
          memset(out, 0, sizeof(*out));
          memset(out_layouts, 0, sizeof(*out_layouts) * max_planes);
          out->sType =
             VK_STRUCTURE_TYPE_IMAGE_DRM_FORMAT_MODIFIER_EXPLICIT_CREATE_INFO_EXT;
          out->pPlaneLayouts = out_layouts;
-         out->drmFormatModifier = DRM_FORMAT_MOD_LINEAR;
+         out->drmFormatModifier =
+            tiled ? DRM_FORMAT_MOD_ARM_16X16_BLOCK_U_INTERLEAVED
+                  : DRM_FORMAT_MOD_LINEAR;
          out->drmFormatModifierPlaneCount = 1;
          out_layouts[0].rowPitch = (uint64_t)native_buffer->stride * bpp;
-         mesa_logi("[P0A-V19-FULLPLANE] anb_layout fallback LINEAR fmt=%d "
+         mesa_logi("[P0A-V19-FULLPLANE] anb_layout fallback %s fmt=%d "
                    "stride=%d bpp=%u rowPitch=%llu fds=%d",
+                   tiled ? "U-TILED" : "LINEAR",
                    native_buffer->format, native_buffer->stride, bpp,
                    (unsigned long long)out_layouts[0].rowPitch,
                    native_buffer->handle->numFds);
